title: Passing Place
text: A single-track road with two drivers nose to nose, and each one's turning is on the far side of the other. Nobody is reversing.
trick: three teleporters on one line: the middle one is the far end of both tunnels, red going east and blue going west; each beam dies at the outer one the other enters by
motif: a single-track road (one walled lane) between two lasers, one turning off to the north and one to the south
expect: depth>=3
